# This diagram highlights component dependencies that cross an immediate
# ownership boundary and groups the selected elements by their parent.
# In the playground, select the `archinsight` context.
# For detailed documentation please refer to:
# https://archinsight.org/doc/querying-the-architecture-graph/#9-group-the-result

MATCH (source:Component)-[dependency:REFERENCES]->(target:Element)
WHERE source.context = $context
  AND source.parent <> target.parent
MATCH (boundary:Element)
WHERE boundary = source OR boundary = target
GROUP BY boundary.parent
RETURN boundary, dependency, target
